==English==
{{wikipedia|dab=television set}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[television]] [[set]]}}

# {{dated|before 1960}} A [[television]]; an [[electronic]] [[device]] that [[receive]]s television [[signal]]s, and [[display]]s the resulting [[image]]s on a [[screen]].

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|television}} [[TV]], [[TV set]]

====Coordinate terms====
* {{sense|television}} [[radio set]]

